%description:
The InF-HH sub-scenario of TR 38.901, with both ends of a link above the clutter, is "100% LOS"
(Table 7.2-4): Table 7.4.1-1 has no NLOS path loss for it, and Table 7.4.2-1 gives a LOS
probability of 1. The channel model's defaults make every link NLOS (dynamicLos = false,
fixedLos = false). The first evaluation of such a link is an error that names the parameters to
set.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.gnb*.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_HH"
# both antennas above the 2 m clutter
*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 8m
*.ue[*].cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 3m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
a link of the scenario INDOOR_FACTORY_HH is evaluated as NLOS, and TR 38.901 has no NLOS path loss for that scenario
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
